    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyasosa imfumu Yawe ati, “Impongolo iyakwingililapo pakuya mu lubansa lwa mwilinga lyamukati ili nokulashala iyaisalwa pa nshiku mutanda isho mubombapo imilimo, lelo pa bushiku bwe Sabata na pa kumoneka kwa mweshi upya, pena elyo muli nokulaisula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kateeka ali nokwingila ukufuma kunse ukupitila pa mpongolo yakuya mu muputule wa pa mwinshi, elyo ali nokulaiminina lwa ku maingwe ya mpongolo pa nshita bashimapepo bakalaleka amalambo yakwe ayakoca, no mutuulo wakwe uwakwampana. Apo pene pa mpongolo epo kateeka ali nokulapepela, kabinge epo ali nokulafumina pakubwelelamo. Elyo impongolo yena ili nokulashala iyaisulwa ukufika ne cungulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshiku shonse ishe Sabata na pa kumoneka kwa mweshi onse uupya, abantu bonse mu calo bali nokulainama pakupepa pa cinso cakwa Yawe pa mpongolo iyi ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwe Sabata, kateeka ali nokulandetela ine ne Yawe Lesa utupaanga utulume mutanda utwabula akalema, na sukusukupo umo nao uwabula akalema, e malambo ayakoca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali uyo sukusuku umo, ali nokulalundapo icipimo ca efa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Efa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cipimo ca fintu ifishili fya menshi ifyafina amakilo ikumi limo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " umo uwabunga, nomba pa twana twa mpaanga pena ali nokulalundapo icipimo cabunga apo umwine alefwaila. Pa cipimo ca efa umo uwabunga, ali nokulalundapo na mafutapo aya miolifa nayo icipimo ca hini",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hini:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cipimo ca fya menshi menshi ifyalingana na balita bane.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " umo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwa mweshi upya, kateeka akalaleta kacilume wa ŋombe kamo akabula akalema, no twana twa mpaanga mutanda nato utwabula akalema, na sukusuku umo nao uwabula akalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali ako kacilume wa ŋombe kamo na pali uyo sukusuku umo, kateeka ali nokulalundapo icipimo ca efa umo uwabunga, nomba pa tupaanga tonse kamo kamo pena ali nokulalundapo icipimo cabunga apo umwine alefwaila. Kabili pa cipimo ca efa umo, ali nokulalundapo na mafuta aya miolifa nayo icipimo ca hini umo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo kateeka aleingila, ali no kwingilila pa mpongolo ya muputule wa pa mwinshi, kabili no kufuma epo ali nokufumina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ilyo abantu bakalaisa pa nshikunkulu kukumpepa ine ne Yawe, abakalaingilila ku mpongolo ya ku kapinda ka ku kuso bali nokulafumina ku mpongolo ya ku kapinda ka ku kulyo ilyo bakalapwa ukumpepa. Abakalaingilila ku mpongolo ya ku kapinda ka ku kulyo nabo bali nokulafumina ku mpongolo ya ku kapinda ka ku kuso. Kwikalaba muntu uwakufumina ku mpongolo iyo ali engilileko, bonsefye bali nokulapusanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kateeka nao wine ali nokulaingila pamo na bantu pa nshita baleingila, no kulafuma ilyo nabo balefuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa nshikunkulu na pa nshiku isha mapepo ayakalamba, umutuulo wa cabunga ukalaba icipimo ca efa umo, ewakulunda pali kacilume wa ŋombe kamo, nangu pali sukusuku umo, nomba pa twana twa mpaanga pena uulepepa ali nokulundapo icipimo ca bunga apo umwine alefwaila. Elyo pa cipimo ca efa umo uwabunga, pali nokulalundwa na mafuta aya miolifa nayo icipimo ca hini umo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kateeka ilyo akalaitemenwafye ukuntuula ine ne Yawe ilambo, libe ilyakoca nangufye ilyakwampana, bakalemwiswila impongolo ya ku kabanga iyakwingililapo mu lubansa lwa mwilinga lyamukati. Ali nokulaleka ilyo ilambo nga filya fine aba nokulacita pa bushiku bwe Sabata, elyo kabili bali nokulaisala iyo mpongolo ilyo kateeka afuma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Yawe alisosele ati, “Inshiku shonse ulucelo, muli nokuntuula ne Yawe akana kampaanga kamo akabula akalema aka mwaka umo. Uyo mutuulo uli nokulatuulwa ulucelo inshiku shonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili iciputulwa icalenga mutanda ca cipimo ca efa ica bunga, ecili nokulatuulwa inshiku shonse, na mafuta aya miolifa umusukupala umo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Umusukupala umo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Walingana na mupepi na lita umo. Mu Cihibulu muleti “pakati ka citika wa hini.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ayakukashila ubunga. Ifunde ilyakuntuula ine ne Yawe iyo mituulo, ala lili nokulakonkwa pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efyo akapaanga no bunga, na mafuta ya miolifa, pefye fili nokulatuulwa ulucelo inshiku shonse kuli ine ne Yawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyasosa imfumu Yawe ati, “Kateeka nga apeelapo icikwatwa cimo ku mwana wakwe umo umwaume, ninshi ico icikwatwa caba cuma ca balupwa lwakwe, cili nokuba e cuma cabo ica cikwatwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba kateeka nga abuula icikwatwa cimo ica citungu cakwe, no kupeelapo umusha wakwe umo, lyena ninshi ico icikwatwa cili nokubwelela kuli kateeka wine, umwaka wakulubukamo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Umwaka wakulubukamo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Pa myaka yonse amakumi yasano aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli bali nokulapeela abena Israeli banabo ubuntungwa, emukuti abena Israeli banabo abaleba mu busha kulwa misha. Kabili bali nokulabwesesha umwine atemwa ulupwa lwakwe icitungu ca fikolwe fyakwe, ico baposeshe pakufuta imisha (Levi 25:8-55).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nga wafika. Pantu ico cikwatwa e cuma cakwa kateekafye pamo na bamwane abaume, ebafwile ukulacikwata pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kateeka alileshiwa ukulapokolola icikwatwa ca bantu bambi. Ni mu cikwatwa cakwefye emo ali nokulapeela bamwane abaume utufitungu uto bengaba nokulaikwatila, epakuti talepokolola abantu bandi bamo ifyuma fyabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo uyu muntu aisa mpisha pa mwinshi uwabelele ku lubali lwa mpongolo ya ku miputule iyali ku kapinda ka ku kuso. Iyo miputule yali e miputule iyamushilo iya bashimapepo. Elyo uyo muntu anangilila incende imo ku mpela iyabelele ku miputule lubali lwa ku masamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elyo anjeba ati, “Kuno eko bashimapepo bali nokulaipikila inama iyituulilwe ngo mutuulo wakufuta pa fyabubifi no wakwelelwa pa fyabubifi, kabili eko bakulapangila umukate ku mutuulo wa cabunga ubo abantu batuulile, epakuti kwilaba cintu nelyo cimo icilepatwilwa kuli Lesa ukutwalwa mu lubansa lwa mwilinga lyakunse, pantu kuti casangulula abantu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
