          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tulubansa tonse tune kuli cila lubali mwali akalilinga ka mabwe, na ku cibumba ca kalilinga lwa panshi ekwabelele amashiko ayakwipikapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyo muntu nao elyo anjeba ati, “Eaya mashiko ayo ababomfi be Tempele bali nokulaipikapo amalambo ayo abantu baletuula.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.24",
